{"id": "Desm68GxORN", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "How was Krishna with 16,108 queens at once? 👑 Narad Muni went to Dwarka to check, palace by palace.\n\nNarad Muni had heard something he couldn't believe: ONE Krishna, in ONE body, living with thousands of queens, each in her own palace. \"How?!\" So he flew to Dwarka to see for himself.\n\nIn the first palace, Queen Rukmini was fanning Krishna. Krishna jumped up, washed Narad's feet, and put that water on his own head. 🙏\n\nNarad tiptoed into the next palace. There was Krishna, playing dice with his queen and Uddhava. He looked up and smiled: \"Narad-ji! When did you ARRIVE?\" 😳 (Narad had JUST left him next door!)\n\nPalace after palace, it was the same Krishna, doing something different each time: playing with his children, getting ready for his bath, offering to the sacred fire, at sword practice, giving cows to brahmins, deep in meditation.\n\nNarad Muni burst out laughing: \"Now I see it, your Yogamaya!\" And Krishna said, \"Don't be confused, my child. I live like this to teach the world.\" And every queen believed he had never left HER palace. 💛 (Srimad Bhagavatam 10.69, 10.61.2)\n\n📚 Want more stories like this for your little ones? Rishi Katha picture books: Books 1–3, set of 3 for ₹500 at rishikatha.com (link in bio).\n\n💬 If YOU could be in two places at once, where would the other YOU be? Tell us below 👇\n❤️ Save this and share it with the friend who's always doing 10 things at once.\n➡️ Follow @therishikatha: in Part 4, Brahma hides ALL of Krishna's friends… and nobody's mom notices.\n\n#krishna #naradmuni #dwarka #rukmini #krishnaleela #bhagavatam #srimadbhagavatam #harekrishna #radhekrishna #yogamaya #indianmythology #hindumythology #storiesforkids #kidsstories #rishikatha", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1792458321, "like_count": 13303, "comment_count": 66, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/